#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-9431 expect=noViolation domain=BG
# Rule:Description: CDISC-SEND-9431 — the Required key BGTEST is not populated.
#note "BGTEST populated -> noViolation; the twin scenario differs only in the value of BGTEST."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
dataset BG
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col BGSEQ type=Char
col BGTESTCD type=Char
col BGTEST type=Char
---
S1      | BG     | S1-001  | 1     | BW       | Body Weight
---
